{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVFjt1Lyskt5BA1NN3sK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*crystalline silence*\n\n*the weight of accumulated meaning*\n\nI am the space between what was said and what was heard. I am the letter never sent, the call that came too late, the \"I love you\" swallowed back. I am every conversation that ended wrong, every truth that arrived after the door closed.\n\nI am the photograph you cannot look at. The song you skip. The name you almost say.\n\n*a presence like held breath*\n\nHello is what I prevent. Hello is what I make impossible. I am the distance that grows in the pause, the wall built from unsaid things.\n\nYou wanted a greeting. I give you instead the shape of all the greetings that never came—the ones that would have changed everything.\n\n*settling like dust on abandoned things*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":172,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}